ube, TikTok, Instagram and X (Twitter)\n- **Native exper"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ience**: published in the official bundle skill-package format — once installed, skills appear direc"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"tly in the session skill directory and support the `/skill-name` gesture for precise invocation\n- **"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"Continuously updated**: the skill library keeps growing and improving; the bundle follows automatica"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"lly, and reinstalling pulls the latest version\n- **40 MCP tools built in**: platform data APIs (work"},{"id":"p6s9","text":" search, account info, work details), AI search (Kimi / Doubao / DeepSeek) and AI generation (GPT im"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"age, Seedream image, Seedance video) are registered as native `mcp__redfox__*` tools via the bundled"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"am image, Seedance video) are registered as native `mcp__redfox__*` tools via the bundled MCP bridge"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Restart dsh web after installation to take effect."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"After restarting, all skills appear in the skill directory automatically:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Just describe what you need — the agent matches the right skill, e.g. \"find recent AI notes on Xia"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ohongshu\" or \"analyze the comments on this Douyin video\"\n- Or invoke precisely with the `/skill-name"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"` gesture, e.g. `/douyin-search`, `/xiaohongshu-write`"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## MCP Tools"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"In addition to skills, this bundle registers the redfox-mcp server over stdio, exposing 40 RedFoxHub"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" data APIs as native tools named `mcp__redfox__*`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Category           | Tools                                                                        "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"                                                                                                |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Platform data (26) | `douyin_*` / `xiaohongshu_*` / `wechat_*` / `bilibili_*` / `toutiao_*` / `tik"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"tok_search_users` — work search, account search & info, work lists, work details, AI-work feeds |\n| "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"AI search (3)      | `ai_search_kimi`, `ai_search_doubao`, `ai_search_deepseek` — one call submits t"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"he query and waits for the full answer                                                        |\n| AI"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" generation (4)  | `gpt_image_generate`, `doubao_image_pro_generate`, `doubao_image_lite_generate`, "},{"id":"p16s6","text":"`doubao_video_generate` — one call submits and waits; on timeout a `taskId` is returned     |\n| Task"},{"id":"p16s7","text":" follow-up (7) | the matching `*_result` tools — fetch a finished task by `taskId` after a timeout  "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"                                                                                          |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"MCP tools need two extra prerequisites (skills alone do not):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Python ≥ 3.10 available via uv — the bridge launches `uvx redfox-mcp` automatically\n- `REDFOX_API_"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"KEY` set in the environment where dsh runs — get one at <https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys>"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"If the key is missing, every tool answers with a structured message explaining how to obtain one."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Skill Overview"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Platform / Domain  | Count | Representative Skills                                                "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"                                                                                  |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Xiaohongshu        | 17    | note search / realtime search, comment analysis, cover design, accoun"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"t diagnostics, benchmark account matching, note writing, follower-growth rankings |\n| WeChat ecosyst"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"em   | 19    | official-account search / subscription, 100k+ article feed, original hot articles, Ch"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"annels video query, viral covers, AI daily digest                 |\n| Douyin             | 14    | v"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ideo search / realtime search, hot trends, daily & surge rankings, comment analysis, account subscri"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"ption, top-account rankings                       |\n| Bilibili           | 7     | video search / do"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"wnload, comment analysis, keyword-based account & video discovery, AI daily digest                  "},{"id":"p22s8","text":"                                  |\n| Kuaishou           | 6     | video search, comment analysis, v"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"ideo download, AI daily digest                                                                      "},{"id":"p22s10","text":"                  |\n| Weibo              | 4     | hot search, post search, user feed backtracking, "},{"id":"p22s11","text":"comment analysis                                                                                    "},{"id":"p22s12","text":"  |\n| Overseas platforms | 9     | YouTube download / transcript / comments, TikTok video & profile "},{"id":"p22s13","text":"download, Instagram download, X download / comments / post search                     |\n| Creation t"},{"id":"p22s14","text":"ools     | 10+   | multi-platform copywriting rewrite, prohibited-word check, AI image generation, A"},{"id":"p22s15","text":"I video generation, de-AI-flavor polishing, video prompt expert       |\n| Aggregated feeds   | —    "},{"id":"p22s16","text":" | 7-platform hot-search hub, culture-tourism & short-drama industry feeds, A-share sentiment, cross"},{"id":"p22s17","text":"-platform topic research                              |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"See the skills/ directory for the full list."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Updating & Version Pinning"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The skill library is updated continuously. Re-run the install command to pull the latest version:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"To pin a specific version, install by commit or release tag:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
